**Definition 8.2 (complete contributor list).** Installation uses the
actual $m_L=|E(L)|$, $m_2=|E(D_2)|$, $d_2=|\Delta(D_2)|$. Include the
Install CTL; $4(m_L+m_2)+4$ tested fresh-bootstrap rows; eight lane TOKs;
full $101U(d_2)\Delta(D_2)$ capture ingress, measurement, descriptor and
seal; return-to-bootstrap; assets, public-head saves/restores, old-frame
count, literal-description emission and all manifest fields; $r_2$-bank
construction and full import; initial extra-list assignments; receiver
and invocation handoffs and Ready. No old $D_1$ length is substituted.
ManifestPrefix's native scan subtotal is
$2h_{37}+4+3s+3z_0+4z_1$ for its actual entry head, field count and bit
counts; every intervening full assignment/Reverse/AppendItem is additional.

For a Convert payload of length $d=r+6$, actual ingress has $2r+16$ INs
and RCA's $11d+22$ body subtotal. Add admission TOK/reserve, Base,
positions, length copy/construction, descriptors/seals and full import.
Add registry lookup, descriptor staging/Seek/closed import, exact parsing
and validation, every arrow's actual word expansion, output encoder and
real serializer. Add channel setup, both copies, print, ACK, post-ACK
descriptor import/registry update, completed-frame update, mailbox and
invocation returns and final Ready. Costs are evaluated consecutively
at their actual successors, not at fresh empty arenas.

The actual $L$-bit published result has copy-plus-print body

$$
(6L+3)+(6L+3)+(5L+1)=17L+7.
\tag{PVC.10}
$$

Stopping at the receiver seal omits its second handoff and is not this
completed body. Base, dry sender emission, actual sender/F/seal/descriptor,
two initialized Allocate calls, delimiter construction, staged descriptor
work and fresh length reloads, completion records, positioning, authority,
ACK, registry and return are additional. Thus for each successful complete
conversion admitted at $s$ and returned at $t$ on this execution,

$$
t-s=17L+7+R_\rho(s,t),\qquad R_\rho(s,t)\ge0,
\tag{PVC.11}
$$

where $R_\rho$ is exactly the recurrence's other actual rows. The target
$k$ is not $s$, $t$, $L$ or the cost of interpreting $k$ old rows.

